# Migrations that are deliberately NOT applied to production, one id per line.
#
# The bundle stamps how many migrations it expects, and the drift banner fires
# when production has fewer. Counting a migration that is intentionally on the
# shelf makes that warning permanent — and a warning that is always on is one
# nobody reads on the day it is finally true.
#
# They stay in this directory on purpose: tests/database.mjs enumerates the
# folder, and that is the only thing exercising them before they go live.
#
# Remove the line in the same change that applies the migration.
202609090026_intimate_games
